Emblems in 3D — licensing summary
=================================

This repository holds four kinds of material under different terms. See
LICENSECHOICES.md for the reasoning, and CREDITS.md for third-party material.

1. CODE — MIT (below)
   src/, scripts/, games/, and the build tooling.

2. THE TRANSLATION — CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)
   translation/en/ and the English of the post-1592 chapters wherever it
   appears. See translation/LICENSE. Citation is requested, not required.

3. EVERYTHING ELSE WE AUTHORED — CC BY 4.0
   World and scene designs, editorial commentary (including world_links.json),
   the Dream mode prose summaries, and the documents under docs/ and research/.
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

4. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL — under its own terms, not relicensed here.
   Three.js (MIT), Tone.js (MIT), GSAP (its own licence — see CREDITS.md),
   and the images credited on research/nymphs.html, one of which is CC BY-SA 4.0
   and requires attribution. Source texts of 1499 and 1592 are public domain.


